                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47e32857-6744-4609-9f9a-19f0253e1c30",
                                                "sense_id": "77b78ade-8aca-3436-a0f0-b0ce62fca223",
                                                "text": "The dryer is a Bermuda Triangle for socks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd2a5afe-cd91-4430-b0a6-38dc7b388c74",
                                                "sense_id": "77b78ade-8aca-3436-a0f0-b0ce62fca223",
                                                "text": "The south polar region of Promethei Planum developed a Bermuda Triangle reputation. Satellites detected intermittent mass concentrations and magnetic field shifts. In 2148, prospectors working near Deseado Crater discovered an underground complex: a Prothean observation post. The odd phenomena were generated by the operation and discharge of a mass effect core, struggling to function despite fifty millennia of neglect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
